{"id":106653907,"slug":"best-in-show-mobius-md-is-health","title":"Best In Show: Möbius MD is Health Tech for ...Healthcare","subtitle":"Fan posting from the American Telemedicine Association's show...","post_date":"2023-03-06T22:46:47.063Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/best-in-show-mobius-md-is-health","wordcount":967,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T22:00:08.643Z","body_sha256":"2e495bf2e73beb9dacb64c7879bab6746cfdf5e49ed6afb06e2d21d0efda8e27","text_words":973,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>What if there is a healthcare technology that… acknowledges reality?</p><p>Healthcare still uses pagers. It still uses fax machines. These things are not <em>just</em> archaic and pointless—they work.</p><p>So, my <strong>Best in Show</strong> prize at the American Telemedicine Association goes to:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.mobius.md/\">Möbius MD</a>. Behold: the apex of design in a healthcare product for the <em>real world</em>. I will show you, and explain to why I am so excited to write about this.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zMus!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fca376331-ea39-4959-98fd-1b733c6a3a25_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zMus!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fca376331-ea39-4959-98fd-1b733c6a3a25_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zMus!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fca376331-ea39-4959-98fd-1b733c6a3a25_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, http